    "title": {
      "en": "Dungeon Experience in WoW: Forever is Now 60% of Classic Era - Blizzard Happy with Dungeon Level Speeds",
      "es": "Experiencia de mazmorra en WoW: Forever es ahora el 60% de la era clásica - Blizzard feliz con las velocidades de nivel de mazmorra"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Dungeon Experience in WoW: Forever is Now 60% of Classic Era - Blizzard Happy with Dungeon Level Speeds...",
      "es": "Experiencia de mazmorra en WoW: Forever es ahora el 60% de la era clásica - Blizzard feliz con las velocidades de nivel de mazmorra..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6af3f184adafe6.72039536\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has confirmed that dungeon experience in WoW: Forever is now 60% of Classic era values, and that they feel the adjustment is working well.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2406555/254\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">We’ve tracked this very carefully, and the hotfix that we deployed on Sunday, November 8 took dungeon kill XP from 40% of the values in Classic Era to 60% of the values in Classic Era. We have subsequently felt that the adjustment is working well to produce dungeon leveling speeds that fit with the rest of WoW Forever content.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has confirmed that dungeon experience in WoW: Forever is now 60% of Classic era values, and that they feel the adjustment is working well. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><br />We’ve tracked this very carefully, and the hotfix that we deployed on Sunday, November 8 took dungeon kill XP from 40% of the values in Classic Era to 60% of the values in Classic Era. We have subsequently felt that the adjustment is working well to produce dungeon leveling speeds that fit with the rest of WoW Forever content.</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/56097-dungeon-experience-in-wow-forever-is-now-60-of-classic-era-blizzard-happy-with.jpg",
    "icons": [
      "inv_misc_fish_14",
      "spell_holy_avengersshield",
      "spell_deathknight_frostpresence"
    ],
    "models3D": [],
